onary future is asserted. Cross-traffic body positions and turning futures also remain unresolved. Latest side views precede reference by up to 42 ms; motion and geometric uncertainty accommodate this small offset for estimated states, without treating ego compensation as dynamic-actor alignment. Unbounded_unknown remains true because nearby pedestrian entry and vehicle futures are unresolved. This revision supplies a finite local road and a supported pedestrian envelope but does not claim to clear the previous planning failure or establish trajectory feasibility."
